# AYN Odin 2 / Mini / Portal (Snapdragon 8 Gen 2, SM8550). Its device tree is not in mainline
# (devicetree= in /etc/cleanlinux/boot.d), so the checked part is the SoC's: the root on UFS
# mounts without an initramfs only with the UFS host and its QMP PHY built in (the arm64
# defconfig makes them modules). boards: the SoC's reference boards, storage chain only.
CONFIG_SCSI_UFSHCD=y
CONFIG_SCSI_UFSHCD_PLATFORM=y
CONFIG_SCSI_UFS_QCOM=y
CONFIG_PHY_QCOM_QMP=y
CONFIG_PHY_QCOM_QMP_UFS=y
# the microSD slot (sdhci-msm) is built in already
CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_MSM=y
